# Xaman (ex-XUMM) sign-in for the "Authorise the enclave" step.
#
# Free key from https://apps.xaman.dev — create an app, add the site's origins
# (http://localhost:5173 and https://heirloom.wtf) to the allowed origins, and
# paste the API key here. The key is public-safe: it identifies the app to
# Xaman's API, it cannot sign anything. Without it the Xaman button simply
# does not appear; Crossmark/GemWallet and the testnet-seed fallback still work.
VITE_XAMAN_API_KEY=

# Point the app at a different HeirloomVault deployment (defaults to the live one).
# VITE_HEIRLOOM_VAULT=0x...
